{"version":1,"content":"<p>亞馬遜正在考慮推出一項名為「World Product Graph」（全球商品圖譜）的內部計劃，試圖建立一個覆蓋全球幾乎所有在售商品的龐大數據庫，即使這些商品並不在亞馬遜平台上銷售，也將被納入其中。這項計劃不僅希望讓亞馬遜成為消費者尋找商品信息的首選平台，還意在應對Meta、Perplexity等公司正在發展的AI購物代理，防止消費者繞過亞馬遜，直接通過第三方AI工具完成商品搜索和購買。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586360.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.967619+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:44:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"dece5facdc7e8bfdc747e73db636ab301eb181db98a6cf6e5dfdc5de20b1c707","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}